From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BayLee4 <63376748+BayLee4@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:40:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 10071: ARM: select the soft-float calling convention for
 soft-float ELF files

ELF files that state the AAPCS base variant (EF_ARM_ABI_FLOAT_SOFT, or Tag_ABI_VFP_args 0 in .ARM.attributes) now import with a new soft-float compiler spec whose default prototype is __stdcall_softfp.
